WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 8.12 · Marketing & Communications
Reputation, crisis communication and social media policy

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
With little reputation to fall back on, one problem can shape how people see you for years.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. List likely crises and who leads the response.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Put safety first, tell the truth and update often.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Write short social media rules now; add as people join.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You draft your crisis essentials and social media rules.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
